  skills:
  - id: magic_bolt
    name: Magic Bolt
    category: 1
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ac4bcfcd2cfca486d8158a1572a5084b, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ ACTIVE - ARCANE BOLTS ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Fires rapid piercing arcane bolts at the nearest enemy. High velocity
      projectile that shreds single targets and gains multi-enemy piercing upon reaching
      ultimate evolution.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Unlock
      description: 'Fires 1 Magic Bolt dealing 20 arcane damage. Cooldown: 0.8s.'
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Empower
      description: +10 Magic Bolt Damage and +15% projectile velocity.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Quickcast
      description: Reduces cooldown to 0.55s (30% faster fire rate).
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Triple Spread
      description: Fires 3 Magic Bolts simultaneously in a forward spread angle.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Arcane Overload
      description: 'ULTIMATE: Bolts pierce through 2 enemies and gain +13 bonus Damage!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: fireball
    name: Fireball
    category: 1
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9c9586ac1ca94ae2b9ce7f24ab485f9, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ ACTIVE - AREA OF EFFECT ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Hurls massive explosive fireballs that detonate on impact, decimating
      clusters of enemies with devastating area-of-effect damage.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Unlock
      description: 'Launches an explosive fireball dealing 45 AoE damage. Cooldown:
        1.8s.'
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Blast Radius
      description: +20 Explosion Damage and +30% detonation radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Twin Flames
      description: Fires 2 Fireballs simultaneously at different target locations.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Accelerate
      description: Reduces cooldown to 1.35s and adds +15 Damage.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Inferno Blast
      description: 'ULTIMATE: Launches 3 Fireballs, 110 Damage, with a massive screen-shattering
        blast radius!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: ice_spear
    name: Ice Spear
    category: 1
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eb2b56f26c3c641169147ddcaa4c2f9e, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ ACTIVE - PIERCE & SLOW ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Condenses sharp glacial spikes that pierce through all enemies in their
      trajectory, heavily slowing down their movement speed.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Unlock
      description: Fires an ice spear that pierces all foes, dealing 35 damage and
        slowing by 40%.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Frostbite
      description: +16 Damage and reduces cooldown to 1.9s.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Twin Shards
      description: Fires 2 Ice Spears in twin spread angles.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Permafrost
      description: Slow increased to 60% with extended 3.5s freeze duration.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Glacial Spike
      description: 'ULTIMATE: Fires 3 Ice Spears, Freezes enemies completely solid
        on contact!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: dark_orb
    name: Dark Orb
    category: 1
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 443559d10747245d4baa17c336580b37, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ ACTIVE - ORBITAL DEFENSE ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Summons shadowy void spheres orbiting around the Wizard, creating a
      lethal perimeter that continuously shreds approaching enemies.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Unlock
      description: Summons 1 dark orb orbiting you, dealing 25 contact damage repeatedly.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Momentum
      description: +1 Dark Orb (2 total) and +25% orbit rotation speed.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Void Power
      description: +1 Dark Orb (3 total) and +10 damage per impact.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Expanding Orbit
      description: +1 Dark Orb (4 total) and +20% orbit radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Void Ring
      description: 'ULTIMATE: 5 Dark Orbs spinning furiously, dealing 55 contact
        damage!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: magic_shield
    name: Magic Shield
    category: 1
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 327ec9cf7f7bf48faa88c9308495a5f1, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ ACTIVE - BARRIER & SHOCKWAVE ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Manifests a protective barrier that absorbs incoming damage. Regenerates
      back to full health after staying out of danger for several seconds.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Unlock
      description: Creates a barrier absorbing up to 35 damage. Recharges after 8s
        out of combat.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Reinforce
      description: Shield durability increased to 60 HP and recharge delay reduced
        to 6s.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Shockwave
      description: 'Shield Shockwave: Emits an explosive blast that knocks back and
        damages nearby foes when broken.'
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Bulwark
      description: Shield durability increased to 125 HP and recharge delay reduced
        to 5s.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Aegis Barrier
      description: 'ULTIMATE: 170 HP Shield and permanently grants 15% passive damage
        reduction!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: might
    name: Might
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 763c6a2e9c2d140e493a9d07789af84d, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ PASSIVE - MAGIC DAMAGE ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: An ancient arcane tome that awakens latent magical power, granting
      a permanent percentage bonus to all spell damage.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Rank 1
      description: +20% Magic Damage for all active spells.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Rank 2
      description: +40% Magic Damage (cumulative).
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Rank 3
      description: +60% Magic Damage (cumulative).
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Rank 4
      description: +80% Magic Damage (cumulative).
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Archmage Mastery
      description: 'MAX LEVEL: +100% Magic Damage (doubles total spell power output)!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: swiftness
    name: Swiftness
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 893d2762706684b0b9c3778aff6531f8, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ PASSIVE - MOVEMENT SPEED ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Mythical winged boots that bestow light, swift strides, allowing the
      Wizard to outmaneuver swarming enemy hordes.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Rank 1
      description: +15% Movement Speed for the character.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Rank 2
      description: +30% Movement Speed.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Rank 3
      description: +45% Movement Speed.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Rank 4
      description: +60% Movement Speed.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Zephyr Agility
      description: 'MAX LEVEL: +75% Movement Speed to outrun any swarm in the blink
        of an eye!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: haste
    name: Spell Haste
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96c0e1d9f15684fd0adc934f6197a79d, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ PASSIVE - COOLDOWN REDUCTION ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Unblocks arcane meridians to reduce spell recovery times, unleashing
      spells like a relentless magical tempest.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Rank 1
      description: -12% Cooldown across all spells.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Rank 2
      description: -24% Cooldown across all spells.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Rank 3
      description: -36% Cooldown across all spells.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Rank 4
      description: -48% Cooldown across all spells.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Rapid Tempest
      description: 'MAX LEVEL: -60% Cooldown Reduction for non-stop barrage of magic!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: vitality
    name: Vitality
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e552f37c9a6e249e7866a57dae849aca, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ PASSIVE - MAXIMUM HEALTH ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: Infuses the Wizard with sacred life essence, boosting maximum health
      and instantly healing wounds during combat.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Rank 1
      description: +25 Max HP and immediately heals 25 HP.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Rank 2
      description: +50 Max HP and immediately heals 25 HP.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Rank 3
      description: +75 Max HP and immediately heals 25 HP.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Rank 4
      description: +100 Max HP and immediately heals 25 HP.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Immortal Core
      description: 'MAX LEVEL: +125 Max HP (reaching 225 total HP) for incredible
        endurance!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: magnet
    name: Magnet
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7039fe009a1ae4bc7be6c1cab4bca63a, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ PASSIVE - EXP PICKUP RANGE ]'
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: An enchanted magnetic relic that radiates an attracting field, pulling
      distant fallen experience gems straight to the Wizard.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Rank 1
      description: +45% EXP Gem pickup radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 2
      title: Rank 2
      description: +90% EXP Gem pickup radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 3
      title: Rank 3
      description: +135% EXP Gem pickup radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 4
      title: Rank 4
      description: +180% EXP Gem pickup radius.
      isUltimate: 0
    - level: 5
      title: Cosmic Pull
      description: 'MAX LEVEL: +225% Pickup Range to vacuum every single gem across
        the battlefield!'
      isUltimate: 1
  - id: health_potion
    name: Health Potion
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 082b5e45caca9473aac78fb933fd2682, type: 3}
    tagText: '[ SUPPORT - INSTANT HEAL ]'
    maxLevel: 1
    overview: An emergency restorative potion that appears when wounded. Drink immediately
      to recover health and keep fighting.
    levels:
    - level: 1
      title: Emergency Heal
      description: Restores 35 HP immediately upon selection.
      isUltimate: 0
